stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PRE_FLOP: start_new_hand()

    PRE_FLOP --> FLOP: betting complete<br/>deal 3 community cards
    FLOP --> TURN: betting complete<br/>deal 1 card
    TURN --> RIVER: betting complete<br/>deal 1 card
    RIVER --> SHOWDOWN: betting complete

    PRE_FLOP --> SHOWDOWN: all fold<br/>(1 player remaining)
    FLOP --> SHOWDOWN: all fold
    TURN --> SHOWDOWN: all fold
    RIVER --> SHOWDOWN: all fold

    SHOWDOWN --> [*]: hand complete

    state PRE_FLOP {
        direction LR
        [*] --> PostBlinds
        PostBlinds --> BettingRound
        BettingRound --> [*]: _is_round_complete()
    }

    note right of FLOP
        deal_community_cards() emits
        on_card_detection_required →
        VisionController switches to
        CARD_READING mode
    end note

    note right of SHOWDOWN
        Signals emitted:
        • on_phase_change(phase)
        • on_pot_change(total)
        • on_player_action(action)
        • on_turn_change(player)
    end note